# Connections — {{VAULT_TITLE}}

Registry of every live system this vault reaches. A vault built only from ingested source material knows what *was* true when the sources were written. This file is what lets it also know what is true **now**.

Scored by the Currency dimension in `_scripts/vault-audit.py` (criteria U1/U2). Only rows naming a real mechanism count as wired — placeholder rows are declared intent, not reach.

