**Mechanism values:** `mcp` · `script` (in `_scripts/`) · `export` (CSV/JSON dump) · `api` (`.env` key + a `wiki/sources/{tool}-api.md` guide) · `manual` (someone pastes it) · `not yet connected`

**Last checked** must be a real `YYYY-MM-DD` on which a read actually succeeded. The audit reads this column literally. Do not backdate a row to lift the score — a stale row reported honestly is worth more than a fresh-looking lie, because the whole point of this file is knowing when the vault's live view has gone dark.

